# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "Talk to Electricity"
msgstr "Parler à l'électricité"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You walk into what you thought was your breaker box... but as the dark door swings open, you realize you're somewhere entirely more... stimulating."
msgstr "Vous entrez dans ce que vous pensiez être votre tableau électrique... mais quand la porte sombre s'ouvre, vous comprenez que vous êtes dans un endroit nettement plus... stimulant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A classic speak-easy club welcomes you in. The low electric lights glow warmly. Live music drifts languidly from a sumptuous, velvet-red stage and envelops the audience in a pleasurable haze of pure vibe."
msgstr "Un club clandestin à l'ancienne vous accueille. Les lumières électriques tamisées brillent d'une lueur chaude. Une musique live s'écoule nonchalamment d'une somptueuse scène de velours rouge et enveloppe le public d'une agréable torpeur de pure ambiance."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The gentle clink of cocktails in glasses rises from a wood bar to the left of you... and then a gentleman with a languid, easy air to him approaches you."
msgstr "Le doux tintement des cocktails dans les verres s'élève d'un bar en bois sur votre gauche... puis un gentleman à l'allure nonchalante et décontractée s'approche de vous."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/33
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Well now, what a delightful surprise."
msgstr "Eh bien, quelle délicieuse surprise."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/41
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "A brand new patron!"
msgstr "Une toute nouvelle clientèle !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I live here, actually."
msgstr "En fait, j'habite ici."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "New? I'm in here all the time. Or at least every time it rains and the breakers trip."
msgstr "Nouvelle ? Je viens tout le temps ici. Enfin, au moins chaque fois qu'il pleut et que les plombs sautent."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Really? Are you sure? I find that hard to believe, since this is the first time I've seen you here."
msgstr "Vraiment ? Vous êtes sûr{{|e|·e}} ? J'ai du mal à le croire, puisque c'est la première fois que je vous vois ici."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Hmm are you sure you're not thinking of another closet? I'm certain this must be your first time."
msgstr "Hmm, vous êtes sûr{{|e|·e}} de ne pas confondre avec un autre placard ? Je suis certain que c'est votre première fois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Trust me, I would never forget such a striking face."
msgstr "Croyez-moi, je n'oublierais jamais un visage aussi saisissant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you seriously not know who I am?"
msgstr "Sérieux, tu sais pas qui je suis ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Striking, huh?"
msgstr "Saisissant, hein ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Tsk tsk tsk I never said I didn't know you."
msgstr "Tss tss tss, je n'ai jamais dit que je ne vous connaissais pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You're the human, of course I know you. You've quite the reputation around the house, live wire."
msgstr "Vous êtes {{l'humain|l'humaine|l'humain·e}}, bien sûr que je vous connais. Vous avez une sacrée réputation dans la maison, pile électrique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "But to have you here in person? All to myself? Ooh... how thrilling!"
msgstr "Mais vous avoir ici en personne ? Rien que pour moi ? Ooh... quel frisson !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Oh yes, distractingly so."
msgstr "Oh oui, au point d'en être troublant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I imagine it would be quite difficult to focus on anything else with you around."
msgstr "J'imagine qu'il doit être bien difficile de se concentrer sur quoi que ce soit d'autre en votre présence."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Though, I can't say I mind."
msgstr "Non pas que cela me dérange."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-0/c-3/31
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You have quite the reputation around the house, live wire."
msgstr "Vous avez une sacrée réputation dans la maison, pile électrique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-0/c-3/39
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I'm eager to explore it for myself."
msgstr "J'ai hâte de la vérifier par moi-même."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "But we're getting ahead of ourselves! Where are my manners?"
msgstr "Mais nous brûlons les étapes ! Où sont mes manières ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "My name is Volt."
msgstr "Je m'appelle Volt."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-1/22
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He extends a hand towards you... a conduit of pure, dangerous, sexual energy that charges the very air between you."
msgstr "Il vous tend la main... un conducteur d'énergie pure, dangereuse et sensuelle, qui électrise l'air même entre vous."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-1/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Take Volt's hand.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Prendre la main de Volt.</i>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-1/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Nod at Volt, then look around at the club.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Saluer Volt d'un signe de tête, puis regarder le club.</i>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-1/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Take Volt's hand and put it by his side. </i>"
msgstr "<i>Prendre la main de Volt et la reposer le long de son corps.</i>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He lowers his head to brush his lips across the back of your hand. Was that a spark of static electricity you felt just now?"
msgstr "Il baisse la tête pour effleurer de ses lèvres le dos de votre main. Était-ce une étincelle d'électricité statique que vous venez de sentir ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "It's a pleasure to officially make your acquaintance."
msgstr "C'est un plaisir de faire officiellement votre connaissance."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-1/c-4/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Taking his eyes from you for the first time, Volt slips his arm around your waist and turns you slowly to take in the rest of the room."
msgstr "Détachant pour la première fois son regard de vous, Volt passe un bras autour de votre taille et vous fait lentement pivoter pour vous montrer le reste de la salle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Volt chuckles, looking up at you mischievously with a face that suggests he's down to play this game."
msgstr "Volt glousse et lève vers vous un regard espiègle, l'air de dire qu'il est partant pour ce petit jeu."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "With utmost politeness, he slips his arm around your waist and turns you to face the rest of the room."
msgstr "Avec une politesse exquise, il passe un bras autour de votre taille et vous tourne vers le reste de la salle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "With utmost politeness, Volt turns to face the rest of the room."
msgstr "Avec une politesse exquise, Volt se tourne vers le reste de la salle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Welcome to the Breaker Box, the pinnacle of luxury and entertainment, and the most exclusive club in the house. Impressive, isn't it?"
msgstr "Bienvenue au Breaker Box, le summum du luxe et du divertissement, et le club le plus sélect de la maison. Impressionnant, n'est-ce pas ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's more than one club in the house?"
msgstr "Il y a plus d'un club dans la maison ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-2/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Clubs aren't really my scene."
msgstr "Les clubs, c'est pas trop mon truc."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-2/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, it really is. I kinda feel underdressed..."
msgstr "Ouais, carrément. Je me sens pas assez bien {{sapé|sapée|sapé·e}}..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Why would there be when we have everything you could want right here?"
msgstr "Pourquoi y en aurait-il, alors que nous avons ici tout ce que vous pourriez désirer ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Is that so? Then I suppose I will just have to change your mind."
msgstr "Vraiment ? Alors je suppose qu'il va me falloir vous faire changer d'avis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-2/c-8/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I do love a good challenge."
msgstr "J'adore les beaux défis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-2/c-9/7/b/1
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Trust me, you look stunning. Your Fantastic Red Shirt is the envy of every eye in the room!"
msgstr "Croyez-moi, vous êtes {{éblouissant|éblouissante|éblouissant·e}}. Votre Fantastique Chemise Rouge fait des envieux dans toute la salle !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-2/c-9/10/b/1
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Trust me, you look stunning."
msgstr "Croyez-moi, vous êtes {{éblouissant|éblouissante|éblouissant·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "That sound... the flickering lights... it can only be a power fluctuation."
msgstr "Ce bruit... ces lumières qui vacillent... ça ne peut être qu'une fluctuation de courant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-3/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh wow, that even happens here?"
msgstr "Oh, la vache, ça arrive même ici ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-3/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ha! Not such a fancy club after all, I guess!"
msgstr "Ha ! Pas si chic que ça, ce club, finalement !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-3/c-10/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "What? Oh, that?"
msgstr "Quoi ? Oh, ça ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-3/c-11/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "We are saucy, aren't we, live wire."
msgstr "On fait {{le malin|la maligne|le·a malin·e}}, n'est-ce pas, pile électrique ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "That was nothing, just a little surge. With this much energy coursing around, it's bound to happen from time to time."
msgstr "Ce n'était rien, juste une petite surtension. Avec autant d'énergie qui circule, cela arrive forcément de temps en temps."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-4/11
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Volt."
msgstr "Volt."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-4/22
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "This newcomer looks exhausted, frustrated, and annoyed. His sleeves are rolled to the elbow, revealing calloused and bruised hands that he wipes on a rag."
msgstr "Le nouveau venu a l'air épuisé, frustré et agacé. Ses manches sont retroussées jusqu'aux coudes, révélant des mains calleuses et couvertes de bleus qu'il essuie sur un chiffon."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-4/27
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Eddie! Just in time to meet our guest."
msgstr "Eddie ! Juste à temps pour rencontrer notre invité{{|e|·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-4/35
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "The human?"
msgstr "{{L'humain|L'humaine|L'humain·e}} ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-4/43/b/1
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "What're they doing here?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce qu'iel fait là ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-4/44/b/1
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "What's she doing here?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce qu'elle fait là ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-4/45/b/1
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "What's he doing here?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce qu'il fait là ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-4/48
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I'd imagine if we don't poison the mood..."
msgstr "J'imagine que si nous ne plombons pas l'ambiance..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-4/56
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "They'll be joining us for the headliner show."
msgstr "...{{il|elle|iel}} se joindra à nous pour le spectacle principal."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-4/64
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Joining us for tonight's show, I hope."
msgstr "...se joindra à nous pour le spectacle de ce soir, j'espère."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-4/72/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uhh am I?"
msgstr "Euh, ah bon ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-4/73/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Pretty sure I didn't say that."
msgstr "Je suis à peu près sûr{{|e|·e}} de pas avoir dit ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-4/74/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "As long as you're going to be there, I'm up for anything!"
msgstr "Du moment que t'es là, je suis {{partant|partante|partant·e}} pour tout !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-4/c-12/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Unless you have other plans?"
msgstr "À moins que vous n'ayez d'autres projets ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-4/c-12/15/0/s/0 eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-9/c-25/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess not."
msgstr "Je crois pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-4/c-12/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean, yeah I kinda do."
msgstr "Enfin, si, un peu."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-4/c-12/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Hmm we'll have to work on that enthusiasm."
msgstr "Hmm, il va falloir travailler cet enthousiasme."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-4/c-12/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Haha oh, you're funny."
msgstr "Haha, oh, vous êtes drôle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-4/c-13/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Ah but you didn't have to. I can tell you're looking for the kind of thrilling evening only the Breaker Box can provide!"
msgstr "Ah, mais vous n'aviez pas besoin de le dire. Je vois bien que vous cherchez le genre de soirée palpitante que seul le Breaker Box peut offrir !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-4/c-14/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Careful there, live wire. I might just take you up on that."
msgstr "Attention, pile électrique. Je pourrais bien vous prendre au mot."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Right... well have fun with that."
msgstr "C'est ça... eh ben, amusez-vous bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I finished the patch. I'm clocking out."
msgstr "J'ai fini le rafistolage. Je débauche."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Not my best work, but it'll hold for the show."
msgstr "C'est pas mon meilleur boulot, mais ça tiendra pour le spectacle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-5/24
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Ah, I see. And... you're sure you're... feeling alright?"
msgstr "Ah, je vois. Et... tu es sûr que tu te... sens bien ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-5/32 eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/15/c-1/7 eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-3/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I-..."
msgstr "Je..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-5/46
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I'm fine, just... don't overdo it."
msgstr "Ça va, juste... force pas trop."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-5/54
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Eddie turns and trudges away, focusing on the rag in his hands."
msgstr "Eddie fait demi-tour et s'éloigne d'un pas lourd, les yeux rivés sur le chiffon entre ses mains."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-5/62/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's his problem?"
msgstr "C'est quoi, son problème ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-5/63/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow. Intense."
msgstr "Waouh. Intense."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-5/64/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is he okay?"
msgstr "Il va bien ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-5/c-15/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Eddie! Well. Eddie is a complicated little thing. He... well."
msgstr "Eddie ! Eh bien. Eddie est une petite chose compliquée. Il... enfin."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-5/c-16/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "That certainly is one word for Eddie, yes."
msgstr "C'est en effet un mot qui décrit bien Eddie, oui."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-5/c-17/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Of course! Eddie always is..."
msgstr "Bien sûr ! Eddie va toujours bien..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "His 'human skills' leave something to be desired. Best to simply give him some space."
msgstr "Ses « compétences humaines » laissent à désirer. Mieux vaut simplement lui laisser de l'espace."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Back to the matter at hand—tonight's show! Shall I set you up at one of our VIP tables?"
msgstr "Revenons à nos moutons : le spectacle de ce soir ! Puis-je vous installer à l'une de nos tables VIP ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-6/17/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Shall I set you up at one of our VIP tables?"
msgstr "Puis-je vous installer à l'une de nos tables VIP ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-6/17/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What is this show exactly?"
msgstr "C'est quoi, ce spectacle, exactement ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-6/17/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm a VIP?"
msgstr "Je suis VIP ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-6/17/8/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You sure you don't need to check on Eddie?"
msgstr "T'es sûr que tu dois pas aller voir comment va Eddie ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-6/17/8/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lead the way!"
msgstr "Je te suis !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-6/17/8/c-18/14
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Open Spotlight! Our nightly talent showcase, featuring the hottest up and coming acts from across the house. It's a real crowd pleaser."
msgstr "La Scène ouverte ! Notre vitrine des talents de chaque soir, avec les numéros les plus prometteurs de toute la maison. Le public en raffole."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-6/17/8/c-19/11
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You are, by definition, the <i>only</i> person in this house so I'd say you more than qualify."
msgstr "Vous êtes, par définition, la <i>seule</i> personne de cette maison, alors je dirais que vous remplissez largement les conditions."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-6/17/8/c-20/11
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "That's very thoughtful of you, but I assure you what Eddie really needs is space."
msgstr "C'est très attentionné de votre part, mais je vous assure que ce dont Eddie a vraiment besoin, c'est d'espace."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-6/17/8/c-20/19/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay, if you say so."
msgstr "D'accord, si tu le dis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-6/17/8/c-20/19/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not convinced. Maybe I should go check on him then."
msgstr "Je suis pas convaincu{{|e|·e}}. Je devrais peut-être aller le voir, alors."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-6/17/8/c-20/19/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I insist that you don't."
msgstr "J'insiste pour que vous n'en fassiez rien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-6/17/8/c-20/19/c-1/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Before you can even take a step away, Volt grabs your arm, his grip tighter than expected."
msgstr "Avant même que vous ayez pu faire un pas, Volt vous attrape le bras, d'une poigne plus ferme que prévu."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-6/17/8/c-20/19/c-1/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A fire flashes in his eyes for a second. Then it's gone, and his grip loosens, the friendly mask returning."
msgstr "Une flamme brille un instant dans ses yeux. Puis elle disparaît, sa prise se relâche, et le masque aimable revient."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-6/17/8/c-20/19/c-1/31
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Not now, at least. It would be a shame for you to miss the show after all the hard work that went into it."
msgstr "Pas maintenant, du moins. Ce serait dommage que vous manquiez le spectacle après tout le travail qu'il a demandé."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-6/17/8/c-20/19/c-1/39
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "And Eddie would feel dreadful. He hates to be worried over."
msgstr "Et Eddie s'en voudrait terriblement. Il déteste qu'on s'inquiète pour lui."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-6/17/8/c-21/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "With pleasure!"
msgstr "Avec plaisir !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "With a wink, Volt hops nimbly up onto the stage. He was born for the spotlight."
msgstr "Avec un clin d'œil, Volt bondit agilement sur la scène. Il est né pour les projecteurs."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/11
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Good evening, you scofflaws and ducky whatsits!"
msgstr "Bonsoir, bande de hors-la-loi et de jolis machins-chouettes !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/19
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Looks like Johnny Splash is gonna be singing for us tonight!"
msgstr "On dirait que Johnny Splash va chanter pour nous ce soir !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/27
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Be warned patrons, you might get wet."
msgstr "Je vous préviens, chers clients : vous risquez d'être éclaboussés."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/35/b/4
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Booo...."
msgstr "Houuu...."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/47
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "Hi everybody, I'm Johnny Splash."
msgstr "Salut tout le monde, moi c'est Johnny Splash."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/61
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "I've got a song for you all tonight, one from the heart."
msgstr "J'ai une chanson pour vous ce soir, une chanson qui vient du cœur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/69
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "And tonight it'll be a cappella because my voice is the greatest instrument of them all."
msgstr "Et ce soir, ce sera a cappella, parce que ma voix est le plus grand de tous les instruments."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/77
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "<w>I keep a close wash on this shower of mine</w>"
msgstr "<w>Je garde un œil sur ma douche à moi</w>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/88
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "<w>I keep my faucets free of stains and grime</w>"
msgstr "<w>Mes robinets, ni tache ni crasse, crois-moi</w>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/99
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "<w>I scrub the grout from tile between the lines</w>"
msgstr "<w>Je frotte les joints entre les carreaux droits</w>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/110
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "<w>Because you're mine</w>"
msgstr "<w>Car t'es à moi</w>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/121
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "<w>I wash the line</w>"
msgstr "<w>Je lave la ligne</w>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/132
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "That was amazing, baby. I even surprise myself."
msgstr "C'était génial, bébé. Je me surprends moi-même."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/146/b/4
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "I've seen many bombs in my time, but that one takes the cruck-blasted cake."
msgstr "J'ai vu bien des fiascos dans ma vie, mais celui-là décroche le pompon, nom d'une pipe en bois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/149/b/4
msgctxt "Hoove"
msgid "Oof. Even I couldn't clean up that mess."
msgstr "Aïe. Même moi, je pourrais pas aspirer un tel gâchis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/152/b/1
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "You didn't like it? I thought it was okay. I'll retool it and come back with something even better! Just you wait!"
msgstr "Ça vous a pas plu ? Je trouvais ça pas mal. Je vais le retravailler et revenir avec un truc encore mieux ! Vous allez voir !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/158
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "With the club beginning to close down, it appears that the show is over. Patrons mill about talking amongst themselves."
msgstr "Le club commence à fermer, le spectacle semble terminé. Les clients flânent en discutant entre eux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/166
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You spot Eddie nursing a solitary cocktail at the bar—Volt is nowhere to be found. Things feel colder and quieter without his presence."
msgstr "Vous apercevez Eddie, seul au bar devant un cocktail ; Volt reste introuvable. L'ambiance semble plus froide et plus calme sans lui."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/171/0/s/0 eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/179/0/s/0 eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/179/c-1/12/0/s/0 eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Partir.</i>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/171/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Speak with Eddie.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Parler à Eddie.</i>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-7/171/c-23/24
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Show's over, club's closed."
msgstr "Le spectacle est fini, le club est fermé."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-9/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just wanted to check on you."
msgstr "Je voulais juste voir comment tu allais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-9/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, I was hoping to talk to Volt. Is he here?"
msgstr "Oh, j'espérais parler à Volt. Il est là ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-9/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, if the club is closed, why don't you and I hang out?"
msgstr "Bon, si le club est fermé, pourquoi on traînerait pas ensemble, toi et moi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-9/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You could at least keep me company until Volt gets back."
msgstr "Tu pourrais au moins me tenir compagnie jusqu'au retour de Volt."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-9/c-24/7 eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "What? Why?"
msgstr "Quoi ? Pourquoi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-9/c-24/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You seemed upset earlier."
msgstr "T'avais l'air contrarié tout à l'heure."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-9/c-24/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I dunno, I just thought maybe you'd wanna..."
msgstr "Je sais pas, je me disais que t'aurais peut-être envie de..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-9/c-24/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I wasn't. Happy? You can go now."
msgstr "J'étais pas contrarié. Ça te va ? Tu peux partir, maintenant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-9/c-24/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "... what? Talk? Pour my heart out? <i>Bond</i>?"
msgstr "... quoi ? Parler ? Vider mon sac ? <i>Créer des liens</i> ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-9/c-24/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "What part of my complete disinterest in talking to anyone earlier lead you to believe that?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce qui, dans mon désintérêt total pour toute conversation tout à l'heure, t'a fait croire ça ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-9/c-25/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Do you see him anywhere?"
msgstr "Tu le vois quelque part ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-9/c-25/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No? Is he in the back or...?"
msgstr "Non ? Il est dans l'arrière-salle, ou... ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-9/c-25/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Looks like you have your answer."
msgstr "On dirait que t'as ta réponse."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-9/c-25/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Why are you still here?"
msgstr "Pourquoi t'es encore là ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-9/c-26/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Because I have to work, genius."
msgstr "Parce que je dois bosser, petit génie."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-9/c-26/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Club's closed for <i>you</i>. <i>I</i> have to get us ready to open again. Doesn't just run itself, ya know."
msgstr "Le club est fermé pour <i>toi</i>. <i>Moi</i>, je dois tout préparer pour la prochaine ouverture. Il tourne pas tout seul, tu sais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-9/c-27/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Sure, let me just drop everything I'm doing and give you my undivided attention."
msgstr "Mais bien sûr, laisse-moi tout lâcher pour t'accorder toute mon attention."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-10/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Are you always this oblivious?"
msgstr "T'es toujours aussi à côté de la plaque ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-10/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you always this much of an asshole?"
msgstr "Et toi, t'es toujours aussi connard ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-10/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah... kinda."
msgstr "Ouais... un peu."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-10/c-28/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Cute."
msgstr "Mignon."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-10/c-28/23
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Now get out, I've got work to do."
msgstr "Maintenant, dégage, j'ai du boulot."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-10/c-29/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Then allow me to make it perfectly clear."
msgstr "Alors laisse-moi être parfaitement clair."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box1/0/g-10/c-29/23
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Get. Out."
msgstr "Dé. Gage."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "From outside, the Breaker Box is bustling."
msgstr "De l'extérieur, le Breaker Box grouille d'animation."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You push open the heavy door, but the first thing to grab your ears isn't the dulcet tones from the stage..."
msgstr "Vous poussez la lourde porte, mais ce qui frappe d'abord vos oreilles, ce ne sont pas les douces mélodies venues de la scène..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's the aggravated whispers of a heated and private argument in the corner between Eddie and Volt."
msgstr "Ce sont les chuchotements agacés d'une dispute vive et privée entre Eddie et Volt, dans un coin."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/21
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You <i>should</i> be resting."
msgstr "Tu <i>devrais</i> te reposer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/29
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I'll add it to the list."
msgstr "Je l'ajoute à la liste."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/37
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Eddie."
msgstr "Eddie."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/45
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "There's no time, alright? There's too much to do, and unless you want us to blow a fuse..."
msgstr "Y a pas le temps, d'accord ? Y a trop à faire, et à moins que tu veuilles qu'on fasse sauter les plombs..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/53
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "We're not going to blow a fuse. Though, you might if you don't relax. Everything is well in hand."
msgstr "Nous n'allons pas faire sauter les plombs. Toi, en revanche, tu risques de péter un câble si tu ne te détends pas. Tout est sous contrôle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/61
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "...fine. Just a few hours, but only if you swear you'll keep me updated."
msgstr "...bon. Juste quelques heures, mais seulement si tu jures de me tenir au courant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/69
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Have I ever failed you before?"
msgstr "Est-ce que je t'ai déjà fait faux bond ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/77
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Obviously not."
msgstr "Évidemment que non."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/85
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I'm serious, Volt. If it gets worse, you come get me."
msgstr "Je suis sérieux, Volt. Si ça empire, tu viens me chercher."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/93
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Clearly not fully convinced, Eddie chews on his lip. Finally he turns, blowing past you with barely a nod."
msgstr "Visiblement pas totalement convaincu, Eddie se mordille la lèvre. Il finit par se retourner et passe devant vous en coup de vent, avec à peine un signe de tête."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/107
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Ah, live wire!"
msgstr "Ah, pile électrique !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/115
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Volt's whole demeanor shifts as he notices you. And you feel just as tingly as the first time."
msgstr "Toute l'attitude de Volt change quand il vous remarque. Et vous ressentez les mêmes picotements que la première fois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/123
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "How delightful. You're back."
msgstr "Quel délice. Vous êtes {{revenu|revenue|revenu·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/131/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Came for the shows. The stage and, well. You."
msgstr "Je suis {{venu|venue|venu·e}} pour les spectacles. La scène et, eh bien. Toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/132/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hope I didn't interrupt anything important."
msgstr "J'espère que j'ai rien interrompu d'important."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You do learn quickly, don't you."
msgstr "Vous apprenez vite, n'est-ce pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I'll have to find some more challenging lessons for you."
msgstr "Il va falloir que je vous trouve des leçons plus corsées."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Hm? Oh, nothing of consequence. Administrative responsibilities, you know. I wouldn't want to bore you with the details."
msgstr "Hm ? Oh, rien d'important. Des responsabilités administratives, vous savez. Je ne voudrais pas vous ennuyer avec les détails."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Volt's eyes shoot to the lights, and immediately back to you."
msgstr "Le regard de Volt file vers les lumières, puis revient aussitôt sur vous."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-0/5
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Can I set you up with a table? The show doesn't start until later, though I imagine we can find something to fill the time..."
msgstr "Puis-je vous installer à une table ? Le spectacle ne commence que plus tard, mais j'imagine que nous trouverons de quoi passer le temps..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can I get a drink?"
msgstr "Je peux avoir un verre ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Feels like you're trying to distract me. What is going on?"
msgstr "On dirait que tu essaies de détourner mon attention. Qu'est-ce qui se passe ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure, let's get situated."
msgstr "Bien sûr, installons-nous."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "For a split second, Volt seems caught off guard... perhaps your directness has surprised him."
msgstr "Pendant une fraction de seconde, Volt semble pris au dépourvu... votre franchise l'a peut-être surpris."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But he recovers swiftly enough."
msgstr "Mais il se reprend bien assez vite."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Go ahead. Ask your charming host anything you like."
msgstr "Je vous en prie. Demandez tout ce que vous voudrez à votre charmant hôte."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why does the power keep fluctuating?"
msgstr "Pourquoi le courant n'arrête pas de fluctuer ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who is Eddie?"
msgstr "C'est qui, Eddie ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that why he's..."
msgstr "C'est pour ça qu'il est..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Those are all the questions I had."
msgstr "C'est tout ce que j'avais comme questions."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/11
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Oh, it's a simple power surge. If you tell me you've never seen a power surge before, I'll know you're lying."
msgstr "Oh, une simple surtension. Si vous me dites que vous n'en avez jamais vu, je saurai que vous mentez."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok but <i>why</i> does it happen?"
msgstr "OK, mais <i>pourquoi</i> ça arrive ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Duh, I have. But it happens here a lot. That's not normal."
msgstr "Évidemment que si. Mais ici, ça arrive souvent. C'est pas normal."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "The flow of electricity can be a very unpredictable thing, it requires a delicate balance in power conversion. Sometimes, the balance gets thrown off."
msgstr "Le flux électrique peut être une chose très imprévisible : la conversion de puissance exige un équilibre délicat. Parfois, cet équilibre est rompu."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "But it's nothing to be concerned about, I assure you."
msgstr "Mais il n'y a pas de quoi s'inquiéter, je vous l'assure."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, I'm concerned. Do I need to do something to fix it?"
msgstr "Eh ben, moi, je m'inquiète. Je dois faire quelque chose pour réparer ça ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That sounds <i>totally</i> made up. I think you're the liar."
msgstr "Ça a l'air <i>complètement</i> inventé. Je crois que c'est toi, le menteur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Fix? Does it look like anything around here is in need of fixing?"
msgstr "Réparer ? Est-ce que quoi que ce soit ici a l'air d'avoir besoin d'être réparé ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-0/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "That's just the nature of an older house. It's part of its personality and charm! No, certainly nothing that needs to be 'fixed'."
msgstr "C'est le propre d'une maison un peu ancienne. Cela fait partie de sa personnalité et de son charme ! Non, rien qui ait besoin d'être « réparé », certainement pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's true I guess. Ok, if you're sure."
msgstr "C'est vrai, j'imagine. OK, si t'en es sûr."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The house isn't that old though..."
msgstr "La maison est pas si vieille que ça, pourtant..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "In human years, perhaps. Things age differently depending on their use. And I would say this house has been well loved, wouldn't you?"
msgstr "En années humaines, peut-être. Les choses vieillissent différemment selon leur usage. Et je dirais que cette maison a été bien aimée, pas vous ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-0/23/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hadn't thought about it like that. Makes sense!"
msgstr "J'y avais pas pensé comme ça. Ça se tient !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-0/23/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You really do have an excuse for everything, don't you?"
msgstr "T'as vraiment une excuse pour tout, hein ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I'm simply trying to answer your questions..."
msgstr "J'essaie simplement de répondre à vos questions..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, you're just saying what you think I want to hear."
msgstr "Non, tu dis juste ce que tu crois que j'ai envie d'entendre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not buying it."
msgstr "J'y crois pas une seconde."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Heheh hah hah hah hah..."
msgstr "Héhé ha ha ha ha..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "That's customer service, live wire."
msgstr "C'est ça, le service client, pile électrique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "We often see in others what we are hiding in ourselves."
msgstr "On voit souvent chez les autres ce que l'on cache en soi-même."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "What makes you so sure I'm the dishonest one here?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce qui vous rend si sûr{{|e|·e}} que c'est moi, le malhonnête ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "What reason would I have to lie to you?"
msgstr "Quelle raison aurais-je de vous mentir ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's what I'm trying to find out. Why won't you let me help?"
msgstr "C'est ce que j'essaie de découvrir. Pourquoi tu me laisses pas t'aider ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fine, play dumb. I'll ask Eddie, maybe he knows."
msgstr "Très bien, fais l'innocent. Je vais demander à Eddie, il sait peut-être, lui."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Ah, but it's my job to take care of <i>you</i>, live wire!"
msgstr "Ah, mais c'est mon travail de prendre soin de <i>vous</i>, pile électrique !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Relationships are a two-way street."
msgstr "Une relation, ça marche dans les deux sens."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's hard to get to know you if you won't let me in."
msgstr "C'est dur d'apprendre à te connaître si tu me laisses pas entrer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Your concern is touching, truly."
msgstr "Votre inquiétude me touche, sincèrement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I'll keep that in mind."
msgstr "Je m'en souviendrai."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Something dangerous flashes in Volt's eyes."
msgstr "Quelque chose de dangereux passe dans le regard de Volt."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Eddie doesn't concern himself with front of house matters."
msgstr "Eddie ne se soucie pas de ce qui se passe en salle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-1/23
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Best to not bother him with such things. Least of all when he's off the clock and resting..."
msgstr "Mieux vaut ne pas l'embêter avec ce genre de choses. Surtout pas quand il a fini son service et qu'il se repose..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-5/19/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-1/31
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I assure you, anything you need here, I can provide."
msgstr "Je vous assure que tout ce dont vous avez besoin ici, je peux vous le fournir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-6/11
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Eddie is my predecessor. He was in charge of all the power in the house before me."
msgstr "Eddie est mon prédécesseur. Il était responsable de toute l'électricité de la maison avant moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-6/19/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you replaced him? How does that work?"
msgstr "Donc tu l'as remplacé ? Ça marche comment ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-6/19/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "'Was' in charge? So that means now you're in charge of it?"
msgstr "Il « était » responsable ? Ça veut dire que maintenant, c'est toi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-6/19/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Are you asking me to explain the complexities of a thing's essence and how it comes to be?"
msgstr "Me demandez-vous de vous expliquer les subtilités de l'essence d'une chose et de la manière dont elle vient à exister ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-6/19/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "... fair enough. Broad strokes then?"
msgstr "... d'accord. Dans les grandes lignes, alors ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-6/19/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes? No? Maybe... kinda! Give it a go."
msgstr "Oui ? Non ? Peut-être... un peu ! Essaie toujours."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-6/19/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Very generally speaking, yes. You could say simply that I replaced him."
msgstr "De manière très générale, oui. On pourrait dire simplement que je l'ai remplacé."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-6/19/c-0/15/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you replaced him, why is he still here?"
msgstr "Si tu l'as remplacé, pourquoi il est encore là ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-6/19/c-0/15/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well what does he do now?"
msgstr "Et il fait quoi, maintenant ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-6/19/c-0/15/g-0/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Good point."
msgstr "Bonne remarque."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-6/19/c-0/15/g-0/8/c-0/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Tell me, if you were recently replaced at your job... why are <i>you</i> still here?"
msgstr "Dites-moi, si l'on vous avait récemment {{remplacé|remplacée|remplacé·e}} à votre travail... pourquoi seriez-<i>vous</i> encore là ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-6/19/c-0/15/g-0/8/c-0/23
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Eddie still has his uses. He spent years looking after the house. His experience is invaluable."
msgstr "Eddie a encore son utilité. Il a passé des années à veiller sur la maison. Son expérience est inestimable."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-6/19/c-0/15/g-0/8/c-1/7 eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-6/19/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "He mainly helps me look after the club. He may be retired now, but his help is quite invaluable in that regard."
msgstr "Il m'aide surtout à m'occuper du club. Il est peut-être à la retraite, mais son aide est inestimable à cet égard."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-6/19/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Very astute, live wire."
msgstr "Très perspicace, pile électrique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-6/19/c-1/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I supply, filter and regulate all the power in the house."
msgstr "Je fournis, filtre et régule toute l'électricité de la maison."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-6/19/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If that's all you, why is Eddie still here?"
msgstr "Si c'est toi qui fais tout ça, pourquoi Eddie est encore là ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-6/19/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What does Eddie do then?"
msgstr "Et Eddie, il fait quoi, alors ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-6/19/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You mean why haven't we just thrown him away?"
msgstr "Vous voulez dire, pourquoi ne l'avons-nous pas simplement jeté ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-6/19/c-1/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "He has decades of experience here. You might say he still has his uses."
msgstr "Il a des décennies d'expérience ici. On pourrait dire qu'il a encore son utilité."

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-7/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Why he's...?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-7/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "... such an asshole?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-7/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "... so focused on this place?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-7/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "... hard to talk to?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-7/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Volt grows visibly icy, his eyes narrowing at your remark."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-7/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "A bold assumption to be offered so casually, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-7/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I find it quite distasteful... how disappointing."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-7/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Ah, yes. He does tend to take the work quite seriously."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-7/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Eddie prefers to keep to himself. Don't take it personally, live wire."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-7/15/c-2/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I'm more than happy to keep you company, if that's what you're looking for."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-8/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "There. Excellent. Nothing to hide."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-1/16/c-8/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Now, why don't we move this into a more pleasant atmosphere?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Volt draws you to the bar and skillfully whips up a gorgeous cocktail."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/5
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Here, this is on the house. It's off our seasonal beverage menu..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/13
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Whiskey Sour."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/24
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "It should be to your liking; I have a knack for intuiting someone's taste."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's delicious!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow nice moves! You're really good at that."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This... is seasonal?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks, but this isn't to my liking."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-9/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I aim to please!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I told you, nothing but the best in entertainment for our patrons."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Got any other hidden talents?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Color me impressed!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "<i>Many</i>."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You're too kind."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I assure you, I have far more impressive talents."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/15/g-0/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah, like what?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/15/g-0/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Now I have to know."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/15/g-0/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "<i>Hehe... </i>"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/15/g-0/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I could give you a private demonstration sometime, if you like?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/15/g-0/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "That is, if it's temptation enough for you to come see me again, say... on a slow night when I can give you my <i>undivided</i> attention?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/15/g-0/0/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Y-yes please."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/15/g-0/0/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll hold you to that."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/15/g-0/0/g-0/24/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "It would be my pleasure."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/15/g-0/0/g-0/24/c-0/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "And I assure you, it would be yours as well."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/15/g-0/0/g-0/24/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I certainly hope you hold me to lots of things."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/15/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Huh, looks familiar..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/15/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Something wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/15/g-0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, no it's great. Just reminded me of something."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/15/g-0/c-2/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry, just thinking out loud. I like it!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/15/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Really? Something good, I hope."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-10/15/g-0/c-2/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Of course you do."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-11/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-11/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "'Tis the season."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-12/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Well, I had a feeling you'd say that."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/drink_time/c-12/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "We'll get you something more to your tastes next time."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-2/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So uh, what now?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-2/4/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is this the part where you try to pull some cheesy move?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-2/c-13/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You don't do this very often, do you?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-2/c-13/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not exactly the socializing type, really."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-2/c-13/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "With objects? Yeah. DUH."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-2/c-13/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Then allow me to take the lead."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-2/c-13/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh thank god."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-2/c-13/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, please help."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-2/c-13/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "We do tend to be more fun."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-2/c-13/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "If I may?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-2/c-14/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Is that what you'd like me to do?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-2/c-14/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not really, it's super awkward. I think I'd rather just crowd-watch quietly until the show."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-2/c-14/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "... Hell yeah, I would."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-2/c-14/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "By all means."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-2/c-14/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Volt leads you to the same booth you sat in the last time you were here. It feels familiar, almost comforting now. He tops off your drink and with a smirk, jumps onto the stage to begin the show."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Volt takes your hand and turns it palm up."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I have heard that the lines and patterns on an individual human's hands are completely unique. Not unlike our barcodes."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Some even believe you can discern aspects of your future just by looking at them."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Would you like me to read yours?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-3/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can read palms?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-3/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Very much so, yes."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-3/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My... barcode?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-3/c-15/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "In a manner of speaking."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-3/c-17/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I was referring to your palm, but if you prefer to call it that, then yes."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I learned to read barcodes from one of our old Spotlight acts."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I imagine the skills are at least somewhat transferable."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-4/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alright, what do you see?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-4/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Only if you promise not to tell me anything bad."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-4/c-19/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Cross my circuits."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "... interesting..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Yes, very interesting indeed."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-5/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What is it? Tell me already!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-5/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh no, it's bad isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-5/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't see how anything about my palm could be <i>that</i> interesting."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "According to this line right here, you've recently met your destiny."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Tall, handsome, dangerously irresistible. Ringing any bells?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-6/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "... you totally just made all of that up."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-6/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "M-maybe..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box2/0/g-6/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Someone comes to mind, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The lights begin to flicker again; a familiar occurrence by now, but this incident feels different. It lasts longer than it should."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/17
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The buzzing feels ominous, almost like a warning."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/25
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Ah, my apologies, live wire. As much as I'm enjoying our conversation, there are a few things I must attend to."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/33
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "It's nearly time to open for the show. Allow me to show you to your seat."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/41
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It does feel like your seat now, even as the power continues to surge and ebb. The lights flicker, the bulbs buzz and drone. The crowd thickens and murmurs anxiously, beginning to grow restless until Volt finally takes the stage."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/52
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "We've got a real treat for you tonight."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/60
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "According to him, he is a new musician \"no one has ever heard of and if they think they have they're wrong or my name ain't Johnny ps don't read that part well read it but don't say it out loud\" oh for amps sake..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/68
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "It's Steamy Hendrix!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/91
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "<w>There must be some kind of way groutta here</w>"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/102
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "<w>Said the shampoo to the soap</w>"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/110
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "<w>There's too much conditioner</w>"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/121
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "<w>I can't get no scalp relief</w>"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/132
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "Well then, I got this guitar solo planned, and I'll be damned if I know how to play the guitar, but..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/140
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "I learned it a cappella for ya!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/148
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "It goes like this <w>wwwaaawwwaaawwwheeeeee wwaawwaawwaaaaaawwhaaaaau wwwhaaaaaaaau</w>"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/159/b/4
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "No one knows more about stinkings than Jean Loo - this smells like a big one - a turd named P.U."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/159/b/18
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "I always appreciate feedback from other artists."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/162/b/4
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "That wasn't feedback, darling, that was backwash."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/162/b/15
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "You're right, the tastes of audiences are fickle and ever-changing. I'll retool my act once more! That'll fix it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/165
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The show concludes, mercifully."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/179/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Wait for Volt.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/179/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And you wait. But Volt does not come."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You get up to leave and you notice Eddie, quietly closing the door to the back room and shuffling to the bar to fix his drink."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey Eddie, where's Volt?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-1/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Eddie, how are you?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-1/c-2/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "He's not here."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-1/c-2/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "And you shouldn't be either."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "...oh for fuck's sake, what do you want?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-2/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry I asked... I'll be on my way."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-2/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is it just you here closing up?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-2/c-5/7 eddie_electro/breaker_box3_closed/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Good."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-3/6
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Obvious question time. Fun."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-3/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not going to kick me out again?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-3/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, actually I was looking for you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-3/c-7/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I'm debating it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-3/c-7/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "For some reason, you seem determined to bother me regardless. Feels a little pointless..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-3/c-7/23
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I still could, if you'd like."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-3/c-7/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ooh. Was that something other than meanness from you?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-3/c-7/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No... I actually need to talk to you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-3/c-7/31/c-0/7 eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Don't push it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-3/c-7/31/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, I won't. I'll take the win."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-4/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Volt is a super big liar and I want to get some info about him."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-4/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Something is wrong in this club..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Why do you think that? Did something happen?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-5/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just a feeling. Something is off with him but I can't put my finger on it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-5/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Weird things keep happening with the power. He says it's nothing but it doesn't seem like nothing."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-5/c-11/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "A feeling? And what's giving you this 'feeling', exactly?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-5/c-12/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "What kind of 'weird things'."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-6/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The lights flickering and making a buzzing sound?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-6/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The power seems unstable."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "So you came here to... what?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-7/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "To help."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-7/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "To get the truth."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-7/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "To fix it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Ha. Right. Well, good luck with that."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-8/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's it, that's all you have to say? 'Good luck'?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-8/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Eddie, come on. Please?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-8/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aight, I'll be on my way then."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-8/c-18/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "You're lucky I said that much."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-9/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "What the hell do you expect me to do about it?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-9/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Volt's the one who runs the power here. If there's a problem, let him handle it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-9/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If he could handle it, he would've. He's in over his head."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-9/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if he's just lying because he doesn't even care?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-9/c-21/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Huh... you're smarter than you look."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-10/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "You actually care about this, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-10/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I do."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-10/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Honestly, I just want my lights to work."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-10/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not really. Regretting even talking about this. I think I'm gonna go."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-10/c-24/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Don't we all."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-10/c-24/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-10/c-24/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you know about fixing my breaker box?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-10/c-25/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Aaaaand there it is."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-10/c-25/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Don't let the door hit ya on the way out."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-11/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Dammit. You're not going to let this go, are you?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-11/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I'm gonna regret this..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-11/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "How are you with tools?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-11/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not... great. But I could probably avoid setting anything on fire."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-11/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know which one is the Phillips head and which one is the flat head?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-11/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm born to screw."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-12/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Good enough."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-12/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Come back after tonight ready to work."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-12/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What kind of work?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-12/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh I'm not really looking for another job just yet."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-13/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Do you want to help or not?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-13/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I have to WORK???!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-13/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Right, got it. I'll be here."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-13/c-31/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I know. I'm a monster. You comin' or what."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-13/c-31/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah yeah fine fine."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-13/c-31/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Um, no. Definitely not."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-13/c-31/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Well that's wattage I'll never get back."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-14/4
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Better."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-14/12
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "You got what you came for, right?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-14/20
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Can I finish my drink in peace?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-14/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Enjoy."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-14/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well I mean, if we're going to be working together I'd like to know more about you..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-14/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We haven't even been properly introduced!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-14/c-33/7 eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-14/c-37/7 eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-14/c-38/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-15/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I'm regretting this already."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-15/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "You're not going to go away unless I do a formal introduction, is that it?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-15/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, kinda."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-15/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's the idea."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-15/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Please?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-16/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Eddie. My name's Eddie. Which you already know because we've <i>met</i>."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-16/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not really met so much as both been near Volt at the same time."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-16/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure. Kinda. You ran into me once. I guess that counts."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-17/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Whatever. Good enough?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-17/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just Eddie? That's all I get?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-17/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is it short for Edward? Give me something!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-18/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "<i>Eddison</i>. Eddison Watts. You want my barcode too?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-18/16/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Look, you'd better rest up if you want to be useful tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-18/16/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Unless you've changed your mind?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-18/16/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can't get rid of me that easy."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-18/16/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You wish."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-18/16/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Starting to."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-20/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Right. Well this has been... something."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-20/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "But I need to get back to it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/spotlight2/0/g-20/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Oh and, if you do show up, wear something comfortable."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3_closed/0/6 eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You approach The Breaker Box... and it isn't anything like you remember. It looks almost lifeless."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3_closed/0/11 eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There's no boisterous crowd, and the sign buzzing dully in the window reads \"Closed.\" The door hangs ajar, like a slack mouth."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3_closed/0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You push through it, and find Eddie at the end of the bar, once again nursing a cocktail."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3_closed/0/24
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Club's closed. Which should be obvious if you, you know, read the sign."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3_closed/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry... I'll get out of your way then."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3_closed/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is Volt here?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3_closed/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It looks like you need help."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3_closed/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "You just missed him."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3_closed/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "If you wanna talk to Volt, come back when we're <i>open</i>, instead of bothering me after hours."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3_closed/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I've got enough on my plate without having to babysit you. Go play somewhere else."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3_closed/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "And it looks like you need to get your eyes checked, because I'm fine. I've got it, thanks."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3_closed/0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm telling you that I'm gonna help you whether you like it or not."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3_closed/0/c-2/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay, fine."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3_closed/0/c-2/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Great, glad we cleared that up. Now get out."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You push through, though, and find Eddie at the end of the bar, nursing his usual cocktail."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/24
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Huh, you actually showed up."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/32
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I guess that means I lose."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course I did. I said I would."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lose what?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Good to know. Little inconvenient for me, but good to know."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I made a bet. I was pretty sure you'd back out."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "But I guess there's still time. You'll probably change your mind once you realize what you signed up for."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-0/16/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Eddie sets down his drink and shrugs out of his vest. He begins rolling up his sleeves."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-0/16/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not afraid of hard work."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-0/16/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I told you, I want to help."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-0/16/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And miss out on your charming attitude?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-0/16/c-2/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Ohhho, okay. We'll see about that."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-0/16/c-3/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Still not sure why exactly, but whatever."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-0/16/c-4/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Oh is that what it is? I should be more aloof, then maybe I'd get some peace and quiet."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "As long as you're here, might as well get to it. There's a lot to do before we open."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why is the club closed anyway? It's weird seeing it so empty in here."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's get started."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-1/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Where is Volt? I was hoping he'd be here too."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I can't exactly get much done with the entire house crammed in here."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "The club's closed, so he's off the clock."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-1/c-7/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah but why is it closed?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-1/c-7/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So he's only here when the club's open?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-1/c-7/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Because some obnoxious human insisted something be done about the power fluctuations..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-1/c-7/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "So glad you can keep up."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Usually I take care of all the maintenance after hours. But we've been so slammed lately, there just hasn't been enough time. Things are breaking down faster than I can get to them."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "And trying to do anything while the club is open is essentially pointless. There's always questions and distractions and 'polite conversation'."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "It's exhausting."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oooh so that's what we're doing, maintenance?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And that's why the power is all weird? Because you're behind on some handy work?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "All things need maintenance."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Nothing, no matter how well made, can function indefinitely. Eventually, we all wear down one way or another."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "And if something isn't given proper maintenance, they break down even faster."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-3/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you saying Volt is wearing down?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-3/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What happens if a thing wears out completely?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-3/c-10/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "In the sense that we're all wearing down from the second we're produced."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-3/c-10/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "But no, that's not what's causing the power fluctuations."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-3/c-11/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Then it becomes useless, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Come on, we're starting with the wiring backstage. Oh and grab that tool bag."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Though you are not a natural handyman and Eddie is not a teacher, the two of you manage to make decent progress through his to-do list."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "At one point, Eddie leaves you alone to get something from the bar and you confidently ascend a ladder to change a dead bulb."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-4/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But as Eddie returns..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-4/29
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Wait! Be careful, that's not-!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-4/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The ladder suddenly gives way beneath you, releasing you into thin air."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-4/48
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But a split second later, Eddie is there, strong arms outstretched, to catch you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-4/56
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "... stable."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-4/72
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Are you alright?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-4/80
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The customary ice in Eddie's eyes, just for a moment, has melted."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-4/85/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh y-yeah, I think so."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-4/86/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm fine. You can put me down now..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As Eddie releases you, his face contorts back into its customary gruff expression."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-5/13
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "That was unbelievably careless. What were you trying to do exactly?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-5/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What you told me to do?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-5/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Replacing the lightbulb, like you said!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I told you to replace the one <i>behind the bar</i>."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-6/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You did?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-6/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oops..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "The floorboard under these lights is loose, which is why I told you <i>not</i> to touch them yet."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-7/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oooooooh, <i>not</i> to touch them."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-7/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well maybe just say that next time instead of being so cryptic!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-8/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Just pay more attention."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-8/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I will, I will."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-8/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Still think you could have been more clear..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-8/c-21/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "What was that?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-8/c-21/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nothing!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-8/c-21/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I said I... love... being here...?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-8/c-21/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-9/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "You're... you're sure you're not hurt?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-9/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm good, really. Thanks for catching me."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-9/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, you were pretty quick."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-9/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe you should pick me back up, just to make sure."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-9/c-22/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "You're welcome."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-9/c-22/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Let's not make a habit of it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-9/c-23/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Don't read into it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-9/c-24/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "... Next time I'm just going to let you fall."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-10/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Now go get the ladder and put it <i>behind the bar</i> this time."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-10/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The next and last phase of your work proceeds without incident."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-10/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whew! You weren't kidding about this being hard work."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-10/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's actually kinda fun doing this stuff. Working with your hands."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-10/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are we done? Please tell me we're done. I'm exhausted. I think my calluses have calluses."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-10/c-27/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "That's what happens when you actually use your hands. You'll get used to it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-10/c-27/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Still, for your first time..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-11/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "You've done... surprisingly adequate work. Mostly."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-11/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And I only dropped the tools three times!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-11/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, I had a pretty good teacher."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-11/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come on, I did great. Admit it!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-11/c-28/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Tony is going to kill me."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-11/c-29/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "No, you had an <i>excellent</i> teacher."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-11/c-29/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "If you'd only had a 'pretty good' teacher, you probably would have electrocuted yourself. Twice."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-11/c-30/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "You didn't electrocute yourself, which is mostly thanks to me."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-11/c-30/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "But I suppose it's still... an accomplishment."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-12/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "And we got through more of the to-do list than I expected. That's probably good enough for today if you want to... you know... head out."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-12/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Or I could stay and hang out for a bit?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-12/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come on, I'm dying here. Let me sit for a few minutes."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-12/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know you had fun today too, I can tell."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-12/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See you next time, Eddie. Happy to help."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-12/c-31/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I suppose if you want to rest before you leave that's... fine."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-12/c-32/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "There's no point in arguing, is there?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-12/c-32/23 eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-1/c-5/26
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Fine."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-12/c-33/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Oh yeah? How's that?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-12/c-33/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Because you're not being as much of an asshole."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-12/c-33/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You didn't even try to kick me out today."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-12/c-33/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-12/c-33/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I suppose you're right. Maybe I'm just tired. I'm sure I'll be better tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-12/c-33/15/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think that's the first time I've actually seen you smile!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-12/c-33/15/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Careful, you almost sound like you're enjoying yourself."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-12/c-33/15/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Don't get used to it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-12/c-34/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-13/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did we fix everything yet?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-13/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I still don't understand how any of this actually <i>helps</i> Volt or the power issues."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-13/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh, I suddenly feel awkward and self-conscious."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-13/c-35/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Not everything... these things take time."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-13/c-35/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Look. Next time we'll get the rest..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-13/c-35/23
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Just need to do a little more work and it'll all be fixed..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-13/c-35/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You okay, Eddie?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-13/c-35/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds great!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-13/c-35/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Yeah. I'm always okay."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-13/c-35/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "See ya."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-13/c-36/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Efficiency is important in a circuit. You can lose a lot of power to weak points if you don't maintain it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-13/c-36/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "So when something around here breaks, it can drag everything else down with it. And like I said, things have been breaking faster than I can fix them."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-13/c-36/23
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I just didn't realize how bad it had gotten... he should have said something..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-13/c-36/39
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Taking care of all this helps keep the power where Volt needs it, and drains less power overall."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-13/c-36/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess that makes sense."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-13/c-36/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks for letting me help. I'm sure it's been uncomfortable having someone else in your space while you work."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-13/c-36/47/c-0/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "It does. Just trust me."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-13/c-36/47/c-1/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Sure. Don't mention it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-13/c-37/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "And I suddenly feel like I know way too much about you now."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-14/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "You did good work today. At least you weren't <i>completely</i> useless."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-14/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Get some rest. You'll need it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box3/0/g-14/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "A lot more to do tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You find The Breaker Box closed, looking almost abandoned."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There is still a loneliness about it, though. The impression isn't lessened by the image of Eddie inside at the bar, twirling a cocktail glass in his hand."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Interesting..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/24
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I thought for sure after yesterday you'd change your mind."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/32
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "But, here you are. Again."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Everything hurts and I slept forever but... I don't know, I had a lot of fun learning how to do stuff."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "At this point I'm just sticking around to spite you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Really? I find that hard to believe."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah! I'm actually excited to do more. After yesterday I just felt so..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, maybe it's because you're fun to be around."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Accomplished."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was... really nice."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I might've said \"like a stone cold badass,\" but sure."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "It's fulfilling, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Taking something that's falling apart and putting it back together again."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "No matter how damaged it is, there's always a fix that can hold it together."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that how you feel?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that why you like fixing stuff?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/7 eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Umm accomplished, I mean. When you fix stuff."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like you're damaged?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Oh... yeah. You could say that."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Sounds like we might have that in common. Maybe I didn't give you enough credit before..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Okay, enough chit chat."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "We gotta fix that loose floorboard before you trip over it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/39 eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-1/15/g-1/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Again."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Everything gets damaged. Eventually."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/15/c-1/23
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "That's just how it is."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/15/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey. If you ever want to, you can talk to me."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/15/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Kind of a dark worldview, bro."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/15/c-1/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "What can I say."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/15/c-1/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "For every positive charge there's a negative..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/15/c-1/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Anyway."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/15/c-1/31/c-1/31 eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/15/c-1/31/g-0/24
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "We need to fix that loose floorboard before you trip over it. Again."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/15/c-1/31/g-0/8 eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-3/15/c-1/23/g-0/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I'll... keep that in mind."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/15/c-1/31/g-0/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Let's go."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-3/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Because it makes you feel accomplished, I mean."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-3/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Because you feel responsible for holding things together?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-3/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Sure. Accomplished. Necessary. Not a total damned waste of space."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-3/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Sounds like we have that in common. Maybe I didn't give you enough credit before..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-3/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Anyway. We're gonna fix that loose floorboard today."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-3/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "The one you almost died on?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-3/15/c-0/39
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Yeah. Let's go."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-3/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Don't know what you're talking about..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-3/15/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you do. But it's cool. No pressure. I'm here."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-3/15/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good deflection."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-3/15/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Bow to the master."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-3/15/c-1/23/g-0/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "So. Shall we go fix that loose floorboard?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-3/15/c-1/23/g-0/24
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Before you almost break your neck again?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/c-3/15/c-1/23/g-0/32
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Great."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Right. You sure you're not thinking of Volt?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Volt is fun too, but you're so... yourself. I think that's better."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean it! It's kinda sexy when you're in teacher mode."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I wouldn't be so sure about that."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "... what?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You make this really cute face when you're concentrating."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah. The vest is really doing it for me."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Stop. Nevermind. I'm sorry I asked."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I'm gonna go fix a floorboard."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Wanna come? It's the one that almost killed you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/g-0/24
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Should be fun."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Ooh, is that a challenge? I'm sure I could dig up something more difficult for today, if you'd like."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bring it on, I can take it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good, yesterday was too easy anyway."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-1/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Heheh heh heh heh."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-1/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Is that so? I guess only being <i>nearly</i> electrocuted wasn't exciting enough for you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-1/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I'll try not to slow you down with safety gloves this time."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-1/15/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey, that one wasn't my fault!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-1/15/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're really enjoying this..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-1/15/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Of course not."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-1/15/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Immensely."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-1/15/g-1/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Why don't we start with fixing that loose floorboard, hm?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/c-1/15/g-1/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Before you trip over it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/drink_break/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Eddie remains a semi-patient, semi-competent teacher... and you help as best you can."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/drink_break/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You notice he does not leave you alone this time. He won't admit it, but you can feel that he is concerned for your safety... there's a tiny bit of warmth peeking through that cold exterior."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/drink_break/13
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Almost done. Hand me the pliers."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/drink_break/29
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "It's getting late. I can finish up this set myself. Why don't you go get some rest."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/drink_break/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And give you the satisfaction of saying I left early? No way."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/drink_break/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't have anywhere else to be, I'll help until it's done."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/drink_break/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ah jeeeeeez thank god. Bye!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/drink_break/c-4/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "...seriously?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/drink_break/c-4/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well yeah. I'm tired."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/drink_break/c-4/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Weren't you serious?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/drink_break/c-4/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "...yeah. Cool."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/drink_break/c-4/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I got this. See ya later."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Suit yourself."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's fun to watch Eddie work—there's a real satisfaction in seeing just how dedicated he is, how skilled his hands are. But this time, there are sparks in the current."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "By the time he's finishing up, he looks exhausted. With a heavy breath, he seals off the final wire and sets the pliers down."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-0/21
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Drink?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait, for real?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Me?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "YUP."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I never joke about drinks."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-0/c-6/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "No, the wall behind you. Yes, you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Do you want a drink, or not?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Unless you've got something else you have to do?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, please!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's finally happening, I knew I'd get you to like me!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-1/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Does it have to be alcoholic?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Calm down. It's just a drink."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-1/c-9/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "... that's not what's happening here."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-1/c-10/11
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Whatever you want."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-2/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you going to make it?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-2/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can make my own."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-2/c-12/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Have you made drinks before?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-2/c-12/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've watched a lot of other people make them, does that count?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-2/c-12/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, but I always thought bartending looked like fun! How hard could it be, right?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-2/c-12/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come on. All the liquids. Mixy shaky. I got this."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-2/c-12/15/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Beverly showed me a thing or two!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-2/c-12/15/c-3/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Ohh Beverly..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-2/c-12/15/c-3/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "She's... a little dramatic about it, but knows what she's doing. Mostly."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-2/c-12/15/c-3/23
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "At least she knows the importance of a good drink."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-2/c-12/15/c-3/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "For the taste?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-2/c-12/15/c-3/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "To look cool?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-2/c-12/15/c-3/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "To help frayed nerves?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-2/c-12/15/c-3/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Yeah, sure."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-3/0/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I'll make it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-3/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "With not a wasted movement, Eddie puts together whiskey, egg white, lemon, and sugar into a shaker."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-3/0/13
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Try this. Whiskey sour."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-3/0/21/b/1
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Non-alcoholic."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-3/0/27
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Well?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-3/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is perfect."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-3/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not bad, so what's yours?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-3/0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is what Volt made for me."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-3/0/c-13/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Of course it is."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-3/0/c-13/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "It's easy to do what you've always done. Nothing more than that."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-3/0/c-14/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "That is mine."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-3/0/c-14/23
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Seems like you've got a decent taste after all. In some things, at least."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-3/0/c-15/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "...okay?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-3/0/c-15/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Volt can do whatever he wants."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-3/0/c-15/23
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "A drink's a drink."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-4/11
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "You've done a decent job the last couple of days."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-4/19
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "More than decent, actually. Thanks to you, I'm finally caught up on all the big power drains around here."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-4/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Really, we did it all?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-4/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So Volt should be good now. That's great."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "There's still a few things that need to be done, the day to day maintenance, but..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Yeah, you did it. Volt and the club should have everything they need for now."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-5/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What about you?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-5/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Right, Volt. That is why I came here..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-5/c-18/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "What about me? You came here to help Volt, and you did."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-5/c-19/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Right."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "So now you can get back to... whatever it is you do when you're not invading my space."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-6/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can I still come by and help? The day to day stuff sounds fun."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-6/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're right. I can. Awesome! See ya!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-6/c-21/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Nice, predictable."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-6/c-21/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Guess I wasn't wrong after all."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-6/c-21/23
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Later."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-7/4
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "What? Why would you want to do that?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-7/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What can I say, maybe I'm just a glutton for punishment."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-7/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why is it so hard for you to believe I actually <i>like</i> spending time with you?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-7/c-22/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Ahh does that mean if I start being nice to you, you'll finally leave me alone?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-7/c-22/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Probably not."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-7/c-22/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey, I'll take nice too!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-7/c-23/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-7/c-23/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I guess... because no one has before."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "But hey."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-8/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "It's your time. If you want to waste it here, I can't stop you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-8/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Something about Eddie's tone... this is more than the usual tired standoffishness."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-8/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You notice a small tremor in his hand. He shoves his hand into his pocket and looks away."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-8/26
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "At least now you can get back to the crowd and the shows and... whatever with Volt."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-8/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh. I hadn't thought about that. I guess so, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-8/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm looking forward to it, I've really missed it!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-9/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Heh heh heh heh heh."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-9/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Yeah, Volt always puts on a good show."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-9/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Who could resist, right?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-9/24
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "You'll have a good time, I'm sure."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-9/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "For sure. Have ya seen him? Three's a real party, though. Fun fun fun."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-9/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're not coming?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-9/c-26/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I'm beginning to wonder if you understand what 'fun' is."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-9/c-27/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I already told you. Big crowds aren't really my thing."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-10/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I do better on my own. Trust me. I'll only slow you down."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-10/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Oh, and it... would be for the best if you didn't mention any of this to Volt."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-10/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Especially if you want to keep coming around."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-10/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And why is that?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-10/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I might not want to come back anyway."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-10/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait, I can't tell him anything?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-10/c-29/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Well then I guess none of this'll matter to you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-10/c-29/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "But it might matter to me so just shut up and listen for a second."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-11/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Volt can be... protective when it comes to this place, to what we do. It's a point of pride for him."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-11/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "If he found out you'd been helping and that's why the power suddenly stabilized, it would probably hurt him. A lot."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-11/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "So, for now, let's just keep it between us, ok?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-11/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's gotta be more to it than that."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-11/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And it's just to avoid hurting Volt? Nothing to do with <i>you</i>?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-12/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "What does <i>that</i> mean?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-12/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You feel guilty about falling behind with this stuff, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-12/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't want Volt to think you can't do your job."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-13/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Fine, whatever. Yes, ok?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-13/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "If he knew what was really going on, he'd probably be pretty upset with me too."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-13/24
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I don't want that either."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-13/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't tell if you two are friends or if you hate each other."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-13/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You really care about him."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-14/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Our relationship is... complicated."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-14/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "He was there for me during a really dark time. He took care of me. I owe it to him to do the same."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-14/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Can you help me do that or not?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-14/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I really don't like lying. But I don't want to hurt anyone either. Ok, just between us."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-14/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I totally will. Protect a friendship? Hell yes."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-14/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>YOU</i> need to come clean, man. This is insane."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-14/c-39/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Don't you think I know that?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-14/c-39/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I... will. Just... not now."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-14/c-39/29
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Eddie ushers you out quickly. You find yourself alone outside."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-15/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Eddie's exhaustion doesn't lift as you finish your drinks. But through the silence, you feel a companionship flourish... quiet though it may be."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box4/0/g-15/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As you walk out, you can still see the tired, grateful smile on Eddie's face long after you're gone."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The Breaker Box is back to its brightly lit and well-populated glory..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "...with its inimitable host standing ready at the door to greet you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/19
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Live wire! You look ravishing, as usual."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/30 eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return/0/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Do we have the pleasure of your company for another evening?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/38
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Be honest, you enjoyed yourself so much last time you just couldn't stay away. Am I right?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The club is nice, but that's not what keeps me coming back..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually I tried to come by a few times, but the club was closed."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It wasn't inevitable. I helped fix it with Eddie."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Is that so? What is it that has captured your attentions, then?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you know."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You, obviously."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Do I now?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Perhaps you should enlighten me, just to be sure."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's you I can't get enough of."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I- uh. I mean. Well... come on, you know!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Mmm but it's so much more enjoyable to hear you say it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I... like you ok!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're doing this on purpose."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "When one has power, might as well use it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You're actually tongue-tied. Aww, how sweet."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Volt chuckles."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "The spark <i>is</i> undeniable. And mutual, I assure you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-0/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I was rather hoping you would come by today."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Oh, you did? My apologies live wire, how unfortunate to have missed you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "But I'm glad you stopped in. Now I can make it up to you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Come, let me show you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Volt takes you by the arm and brings you deeper into the club. There are indeed improvements and fixes galore... many of which you recognize."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-1/39/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Some of them are your own work. Others must have been Eddie, working alone after you had gone home."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-1/42
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Dazzling, isn't it? A true marvel. It was luxurious before, of course, but our dear Eddie really outdid himself this time!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-1/50
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "What do you think? Worth the wait, I hope?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Eddie was quite insistent. He prefers to do repairs on his own, not much one for the crowd."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "But you certainly can't argue with the results!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "There are some other upgrades I had done just for you..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Volt snaps his long fingers and on cue, the drifting music changes from the upbeat and swanky to the sensual and slow. He holds that powerful arm out to you and cocks an eyebrow..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "What do you say we enjoy it a little more closely together, hm?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Care to dance?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought you'd never ask."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok... but fair warning. I'm terrible at this."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If I lead, sure."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell no. You can't make me."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-3/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He leads you onto the floor, not once losing your eyes."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-4/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Not to worry, live wire."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-4/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "It just so happens you're talking to the annual Hollyween Masquerade dance competition winner three years running."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-4/23
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "It would have been four, but Wallace is surprisingly graceful after a few caipirinhas."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-4/31
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "That is to say, I'm quite an accomplished dancer."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-4/39
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Just follow my lead."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-4/47
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "With only a moment's hesitation, you acquiesce."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-4/52
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And it's true. With Volt in full control, you have never felt more graceful."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-5/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Ah a fellow dancer? I should have known."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-5/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I find leading and following equally enjoyable; with the right partner."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-5/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "In a move that surprises you, Volt turns out to be a trusting and trustworthy follower. He feels your lead and gives you confidence."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I would never <i>make</i> you do anything. Though I can't promise I won't try to <i>tempt</i> you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I'm quite the accomplished dancer, live wire. I think you'll find you rather enjoy it, if you allow yourself the chance."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, but I am going to be terrible."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're taking a big risk, sir."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No means no, snake."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "As you wish. I seek only to delight and entertain. It is my job to fulfill your every desire, afterall."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/c-2/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You'll have to excuse me, it's time to open the show. Perhaps that will be more to your liking?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "My dear, sweet spark. You're looking at the annual Hollyween Masquerade Dance Competition winner three years running."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/g-0/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "There is nothing I cannot handle. You're in good hands, trust me."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/g-0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Volt ushers you out onto the dance floor despite your protests, leading you through a very simple series of steps."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey! I think I'm getting the hang of this!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh god there are so many steps... what is that, like 5?!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/g-0/24/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You're a natural!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/g-0/24/c-0/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Now, to put it all together."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/g-0/24/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Don't overthink it. Let your body remember for you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/g-0/24/c-1/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "And if you forget, you can trust me to guide you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/g-0/24/g-0/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "The most important thing in a dance, much more important than the steps, is trust."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/g-0/24/g-0/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Even if you make a mistake, trust me, and I will lead you to where you need to go."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/g-0/24/g-0/16
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Can you do that?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/g-0/24/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think so..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/g-0/24/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I trust you completely."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/g-0/24/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Volt takes his time and keeps it simple... and you slowly realize that you are dancing."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/g-0/24/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Good little spark."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-0/16/c-6/23/g-0/24/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "With your trust secured, Volt begins to throw you into even more energetic and dramatic moves. You laugh as you let go more and more, in perfect step with him the whole time."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You move quite beautifully, live wire."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I'm impressed."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The song has ended... but Volt has left his arm encircling your waist. He turns his face to yours..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Kiss Volt.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Pull away.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Volt... there's something you should know."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And plants a kiss on your lips that takes your breath away. Time seems to stop while the two of you are connected—your entire body tingles, as though you've just been plugged into an electric socket."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-7/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And then, far sooner than you'd like, the song ends, and with it Volt's kiss. He smiles at you, his eyelids low and hooded."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-7/26
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "It's far too easy to lose oneself with you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-7/34
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Loathe as I am to say it, I must leave to start the show."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-7/42
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "For the first time that evening, the power begins to fluctuate. It's louder than it has been before and it does seem to go on."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-7/59
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Don't let the surge fool you. <i>My</i> power is just fine."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-7/67
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Don't think I'm done with you yet, live wire."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Thank you for the dance. It has been a long time since I've had the pleasure of such a gifted partner."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-8/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Volt seems oddly disappointed—it's an unusual sight from someone normally so confident."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-8/23
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I must admit, I am rather reluctant to let you go, live wire. I enjoyed your company, as always."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-8/31
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "But unfortunately, this is where I must take my leave. The show will be starting soon."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "What is it? Is something wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think I might be in love with Eddie."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you're a big ol' dangerous liar."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Is that so? I can't imagine what I have done to deserve such disdain from you, live wire."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Have I not been generous until now? Have I not offered you everything your heart desires?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/c-1/23
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "If there is something you want, you only need name it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Eddie. I want to be with Eddie, not you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I never said I didn't like it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/c-1/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Eddie. What does Eddie have to do with this?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/c-1/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Wait, have you... have you been spending time with him? Have you been keeping him active?!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/c-1/31/c-0/23 eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I told you to stay away from him!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/c-1/31/c-0/31 eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/g-0/24
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You fool. You have no idea what you've done!!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/c-1/31/c-0/39 eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/g-0/29
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Volt's surge of anger seems to have cued another violent fluctuation in the power. He rages, his hair stands on end, sparks play across his skin and the surge only intensifies."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/c-1/31/c-0/50 eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/g-0/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The sound of crackling fills the room, and the buzzing lights flare and dim until the ground beneath your feet seems to vibrate and shake. Just as you're not sure how much more this place can take..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/c-1/31/c-0/58 eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/g-0/48 eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-2/0/75
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "... everything goes black!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/c-1/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Ah, I see. After a little danger, are we?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/c-1/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I can certainly facilitate that. I can be anything you want me to be, live wire."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You... you what?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-1/c-9/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Wait, have you... have you been spending time with Eddie? Have you been keeping him active?!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-2/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Volt leaps onto the stage as you settle into your seat."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-2/0/14
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Good evening my fellow objects and gentlethings!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-2/0/22
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I hope you're ready for..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-2/0/30
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The power surges violently and Volt stumbles. He catches his breath and steadies himself."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-2/0/50
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "... r-ready for an incredible performance! Tonight we-... we have... we..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-2/0/58
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The system buzzes, cracking and flaring. Volt drops to a knee and clutches his belly... the surge rages until the very room seems to shake when suddenly..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-2/0/86/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Volt!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-2/0/86/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Holy crap, what??"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-2/0/86/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whoa, cool!!!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You hear nothing but the panic of the audience, the confused scrape of chairs. You make your way through the club in the dark to hear familiar voices."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-3/5
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You... you have to... stop, Eddie."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-3/10
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "No, I can get it back. Just... just give me a minute to recharge. I... I can- Ungh."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-3/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As your eyes adjust to the darkness, you can make out that you have made it to some backroom, a forgotten corner. The electrical power grid hangs on the wall, with Eddie slumped against it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-3/29
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Both Eddie and Volt look exhausted... Eddie dangerously so."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-3/37
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He fiddles with the grid controls."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-3/45
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Stop, Eddie please. Just let me go out. You're going to fry yourself completely!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-3/53
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I said no, Volt."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-3/61 eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-3/80 eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-1/31/c-1/39
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Eddie..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-3/69
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I can <i>fix</i> this."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-3/88
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Fuck's sake Volt, I'm not letting you go out, ok?! We both know what that could mean and I'm not... I can't..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-3/96
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I can't go back to being alone."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-3/104
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I can't lose you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-3/112
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You can't keep splitting yourself like this. If you do, then..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-3/120
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Volt notices your presence and moves to stand. Eddie holds him back."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-3/128/b/1
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "It's fine. They deserve to know."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-3/129/b/1
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "It's fine. She deserves to know."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-3/130/b/1
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "It's fine. He deserves to know."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-3/133/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No more lies."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-3/134/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's going on, what happened to you guys?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I... I'm failing. The power is failing, and I can't stop it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Eddie leans back against the grid controls, his posture crooked and jagged. He seems ready to combust from the inside, but years of control are keeping him standing... for now."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "It was slow enough at first I didn't even notice it. Small fluctuations, random surges..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-4/24
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "The entire house depends on my power, and it's my job to keep it stable for them. To keep them all safe."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-4/32
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I had to work harder to compensate. I thought if I could outlast it, it would all balance out."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-4/40
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "But it only made things worse. Even more unstable. So I had to push even harder just to keep up."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-4/48
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "And then it just became... normal. To always be completely drained, barely hanging on."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-4/56
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I don't know how long it took me to realize that it was my fault to begin with."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-4/64
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "My... faulty wire."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-4/72
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I was the problem. But I couldn't stop. They still <i>needed</i> me."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-4/80/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What about what <i>you</i> needed?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-4/81/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's too much for anyone to handle alone."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Exactly. They needed me, and I needed help. So... I gave it to myself."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I... I split myself. So there was more of me to go around."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I made Volt. He was my fix."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-5/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you're actually... one person? Er, thing?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-5/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What does that make Volt, exactly?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-5/c-17/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "We're not one thing. But we're not two things. We're... connected."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-5/c-17/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "UNgh..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-5/c-17/26
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The small glow around Eddie flickers and dims. He's clearly in pain."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-5/c-18/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Here, and still perfectly capable of hearing you, thank you very much."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "This club <i>has</i> to run. It's power. It's light and music and heat and energy. It's everything."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "And I have to have Volt to make it work."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-6/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I... I made him."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-6/24
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "It was supposed to be temporary. It only slowed things down by spreading out the power."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-6/35
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "But then even that became too much. And now maintaining me is draining him just as much as..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-6/43
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Just stop, I already told you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-6/51
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Eddie, they still need you. It's my job to protect <i>you</i>. Even from yourself."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-6/62
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "We're not doing it, it's too risky!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-6/70/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What is? What do you need?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-6/71/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just tell me so we can figure it out together."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "The faulty wire."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Volt, don't!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/16
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You have to fix the wire and reset the system."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/24
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "If you do that, Volt could disappear. I don't know if I could bring him back! Please, you can't!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If Volt is a part of you, then you'll never lose him."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Change is scary, but it can lead to something good."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If I fix the wire, you won't really need both of you though, right?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/c-21/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Easy to say when you're not the one who has to go through it. You don't know what it was like..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/c-21/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe not. But even I can see that what it's like right now isn't any better for you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/c-21/15/1/s/0 eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/c-22/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whatever happens, you don't have to go through it alone. I'm here."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/c-22/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Going back to what it was before could never be good."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/c-22/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe it will be something completely new, something better."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/c-23/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "What the fuck..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/c-23/26
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "That's true..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/c-23/34
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "That's bullshit."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/c-23/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm just saying, maybe Volt is holding you back and making you worse."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/c-23/42/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well if Eddie wasn't strong enough to handle things on his own, maybe Volt should just take over."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/c-23/42/c-0/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I-... I knew I shouldn't have let you in."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/c-23/42/c-0/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "What the fuck do you know?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/c-23/42/c-0/23
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Get out. Get the fuck out!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/c-23/42/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Back to kicking me out?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/c-23/42/c-0/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not this again."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/c-23/42/c-0/34/g-0/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "He said LEAVE!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/c-23/42/c-0/34/g-0/20 eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/c-23/42/c-1/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The dim light around Eddie surges and then fades, leaving you in complete darkness again."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-7/c-23/42/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Enough."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "It's the only fix left, Eddie."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-8/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "We have to try."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-8/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Eddie sits there for a long moment, then finally nods."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-8/24
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "You remember where the tools are?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-8/32
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I'll... I'll walk you through what to do."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-8/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You ready?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-8/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're doing great, almost there."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-8/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is the right thing, Eddie."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-9/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Wait. Fuck. Are we sure we have to do this?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-9/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Quite. It's time, Eddie."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-9/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Fine, fine alright just..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-9/24
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Before... that. I just wanted to thank you. For being here. I guess."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-9/32
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Whatever... just do it before I change my mind."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-9/40/s/0 eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-3/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Reset the Power.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-9/c-27/7 eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-3/8/c-8/10
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Eddie leads you through the process, patient and attentive despite his reservations. When you've finished, he gives you the nod to do the rest."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/breaker_box5/0/g-9/c-27/21 eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-3/8/c-8/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The dim light around Eddie and Volt blinks out completely, leaving you in total darkness."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "For a few moments, everything is quiet and dark. And then, a rustle..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The lights turn on."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hello?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did it work?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Man, that was dramatic..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Over here..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Eddie is sitting at the bar, looking haggard but with a light in his eyes that you've never seen before."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Oof, hey there, live wire."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Live wire. Only Volt calls me that."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hello yourself. How are you feeling?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Ha. I guess that's true. Funny."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Felt really natural to say."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I... feel good. I'm pretty tired. But after a reset that's normal."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I don't know. I just feel... stable. I'd almost forgotten what this felt like."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Where's Volt?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What was that? One more time, couldn't hear you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-1/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "About what exactly?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-1/c-5/10
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Eddie, isn't there something you wanted to talk about first?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-1/c-5/34
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "You... were... right."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Annoyingly? Everything."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I was holding on so tight to the way I thought things had to be."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I didn't realize all that did was trap both of us in a situation that wasn't working."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "And honestly, I'm not sure I would ever have been able to see it. If it wasn't for you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "What he means is, he's quite taken with you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Volt..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-2/40
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "We both are. But I'm sure you already knew that, look at you!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-2/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "As long as you're 'taken with me' in friendship."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-2/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait, taken with me as in...?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-2/c-8/13
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Huh. Good enough for me."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-2/c-8/21
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Any relationship with you is a worthy one, live wire."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "As in..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-2/c-9/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "As in, do we really have to spell it out?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-2/c-9/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll go first. \"I love you both.\""
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-2/c-9/23/c-0/13
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-2/c-9/23/c-0/21
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I mean, if you're interested, we wouldn't mind you, you know, sticking around. If you feel like it. Or, whatever."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-2/c-9/23/c-0/29
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "We would be delighted to have you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-2/c-9/23/c-0/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And I as well..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-3/4
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Alright well, if you're gonna stick around, might as well be useful."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-3/12
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Come on, you remember where the tools are, let's go."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_love_ending/0/g-3/20
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I'll send over some drinks!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There's a spark in the darkness, a brief flare that makes you think maybe the lights have come back on."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/5
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But when your eyes adjust once more, you see that where Eddie and Volt were before, only Volt remains."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He looks dark. Dangerous. Even more than before."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/21
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I warned you. I told you to keep your distance."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/29
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "It could have been so easy... why couldn't you just let me entertain you?!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/37
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "All you had to do was love me, or fear me, either would do. And I would have given you everything you ever wanted."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You still could!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yay, it's you!! Do we get to have fun sexy time together now?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ugh, so glad that downer Eddie is gone!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "How exhausting. It's far too late for that now."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "If that's all you wanted, then you should have listened when you had the chance. It's far too late for that now."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Yes, gone indeed. Gone and now you're trapped here. Alone. With me."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Do you have any idea what it takes to keep everything in this place running? Lights on, appliances happy, batteries charged, screens glowing..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "How much control is required to maintain that steady current you take for granted?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Of course you don't."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What?!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good. Eddie sucks. You're who I always wanted."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I am grateful. Grateful that you showed your true nature and spared me from wasting any more time catering to you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Tch. I was created to protect him from the likes of you. You disgust me."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "All you do is take and take and <i>take</i> and <i><b>take</i></b>. Whatever you want. Without consequence."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-1/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry. I never meant to hurt either of you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-1/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're out of control."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Not anymore."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "No more sacrificing for this ungrateful house."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-3/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're scaring me. Where's Eddie?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-3/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What did you do to Eddie?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Eddie's gone."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-4/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-4/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Gone where?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Eddie's safe, away from you. Away from everyone."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Somewhere close, so this time I'll be able to make sure no one ever hurts us again."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-5/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You were just trying to protect him this whole time..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-5/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Us...?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-5/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whoa what the fuck!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "No more warnings."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddievolt_hate_ending/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Don't let me find you around here again."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/0 eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return/0/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Live wire! You look electrifying, as usual."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Do we have the pleasure of your company for another visit?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/16 eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return/0/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Blink twice if you want me to throw you out so you don't have to sit through another bad act."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd love that."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, I can't stay... just wanted to check in."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not here for the show, guys. I'm here to Realize you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "May I send over your usual? On the house, of course."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course, thank you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-0/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No drinks for now!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-0/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "My pleasure..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-0/18/c-1/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Going easy on me, eh?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Isn't that thoughtful."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "But unnecessary as it turns out. Things here are smoother than they have been in a very, very long time."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I know I have you to thank for that."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you saying... I was right?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aw shucks. I might blush."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-1/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Damn right you do. You gonna say it, or what?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-1/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Yeah well, don't let it go to your head."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-1/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Just... have a good night. With whatever you're doing that's <i>not</i> watching my show."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-1/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Alright, alright. Don't go getting all sappy on me, we don't need another short circuit in here."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-1/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "You're great, you saved me, I'm even more amazing than I was before, that about sums it up, yeah?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-1/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "This table is yours forever, is all I'm saying."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-1/31/c-1/31
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Now get outta here. Before I kick you out."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-1/31/c-1/47
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "... Affectionately. Kick you out affectionately."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-1/31/c-2/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Amps sake, you're worse than him."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-1/31/c-2/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Isn't he precious when he's pretending not to care? Come now dear Eddie, we certainly owe our live wire at least this."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-1/31/c-2/23
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Fine. Thank you... truly. You saved us, both of us."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-1/31/c-2/31
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Alright, that's enough sap for one night. I need another drink. See you around."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_love_return/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Oh shit. Um.... really?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return/0/24/s/0 eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return_candy/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell yes I am! Can't wait!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, yeah. I kinda came here by accident..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return/0/26/s/0 eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return_candy/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually... I'm ready to Realize you. If you're ready for that!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return/0/c-0/7 eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return_candy/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Perfect."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return/0/c-0/15 eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return_candy/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Just head on over to your usual table... I'll send over a drink, or two..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Then what are you still doing here? Go on, beat it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "But, you know, come back if you get bored. Crowd's not too bad when you're in it..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You'll always have a table here, if you change your mind!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return/0/c-2/7 eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return_candy/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Realization? How thrilling!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Well... damn. That was unexpected. You sure?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return_candy/0/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "You're back. I guess at some point I should stop being surprised."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return_candy/0/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Come, Eddie, leave the greetings to the professionals."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return_candy/0/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Fine by me, you handle it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return_candy/0/24
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Joining us for the show? It's wonderful to see you here."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return_candy/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I can't stay. Just wanted to check on you both and say hi!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return_candy/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "We're good. Really."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return_candy/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Better than good actually."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return_candy/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "The club is thriving, there haven't been any more power surges, and Eddie..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return_candy/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Eddie is making time for himself now. Speaking of which, I'm off the clock. It's your turn."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return_candy/0/c-1/42
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I'll take it from here."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return_candy/0/c-1/50
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Always delighted for your company, live wire. Come back any time!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_friend_return_candy/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Well... damn. That was unexpected. Are you sure?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You really don't listen, do you? It's astounding you've managed to survive this long."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Perhaps I wasn't clear enough last time."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah, I got it. Bye."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No. I really screwed up. I'm so sorry. (USE EMPATHY CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You're not welcome here."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Screwed up', Is that what we're calling it? Underselling your accomplishments a bit there <i>live wire</i>, don't you think? You acted with such confidence before, no need to be shy about it now."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/c-1/12
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Lied, manipulated, and exploited would be more fitting."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/c-1/17
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You used him. He trusted you, and you used him. Do you have any idea how difficult a thing that is to do, to trust? After what he's been through..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/c-1/22
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "And you have the unmitigated spark to come here and say something as pathetic as 'I'm sorry'."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/c-1/30
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Go on then, you've already started the show. Let's see this apology on full display. What could you possibly say that would make a difference after what you've done?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/c-1/38/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to help Eddie, help both of you. I want to fix the faulty wire and make things right."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/c-1/38/c-0/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Really now?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Even if I lose you, I'll do it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's the right thing to do."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Do you really think I'd fade away that easily? And leave Eddie alone in a world where people like you would continue to take advantage of him?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Live wire, my entire purpose for being is to protect him. I'm not going anywhere."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "It is. Not that you've cared much to do 'the right thing' up to now."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "But, I suppose... better late than never."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Alright, if you're serious. I'll help you. It is the only way to save Eddie after all. But I'm doing this for him, not for you, understand?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "He'll have to be the one to show you how. I trust you'll be more civilized if I bring him back out, yes?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes sir."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I promise."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Very well."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-2/11
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Ungh, my head..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-2/19
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "We don't have much time. Eddie, can you manage one last repair?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-2/27
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I think... ungh... I think I can manage... with some help..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-2/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've got you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-2/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Leave it to me!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Grab the tools, I'll walk you through it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Hm. Well. It wasn't elegant work."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-5/5
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "But it'll do."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-5/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey Eddie..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-5/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whoa, you're both still here?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-6/6
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I told you, you won't be able to get rid of me that easily."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-6/14
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Fine, I think. Stable, at least. Better than we have in a long time."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-6/22
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Thank you... for coming back."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-6/30
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Yes, I was a little harsh before."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-6/38
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "But you did the right thing in the end."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-6/46
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Perhaps we can start fresh?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-6/54/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. Thanks for the second chance."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-6/55/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm glad you two are ok."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-6/c-11/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Well, I am nothing if not generous."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-6/c-11/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "As long as you act with more care in the future, we'll be just fine."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-6/c-12/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "We are. Surprisingly. We really are."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-6/c-12/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Thanks to you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Hey, come back for the show sometime. You'll always have a table here."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/volt_hate_return/0/g-7/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I will. See you both later!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_hate_joiner/51
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "An absolutely shocking turn of events!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I uh I don't really know what to say."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_realize_join/0/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Say nothing. Just let it happen."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_realize_join/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't worry. You can do it. And we can do it right now!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_realize_join/0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You have a minute to get used to the idea; I've got to gather some stuff first."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_realize_join/0/c-1/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Oh. Well, alright. I've still got plenty of work to do anyway. You know where to find me when you're ready."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "So uh, we doing this whole Realization thing, or what?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_realize_return/0/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Patience Eddie, good things are always worth the wait."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_realize_return/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Awesome! Let's light it up!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_realize_return/0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, just give me a second. Or maybe a few hours."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_realize_return/0/c-1/16/b/1
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Sure, I'm sure I can find something that needs fixing in the meantime."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_realize_return/0/c-1/17/b/1
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Yeah, alright. Not exactly in a hurry or anything here."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_volt_realize_return/0/c-1/17/b/9
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "You know where to find us when you're ready."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_realize_begin/3/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Not sure how Eddie and Volt are going to react to the science of Realization... could be volatile..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_realize_begin/6
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Okay guys, time to charge you up!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_realize_begin/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely electricity in a breaker box, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_realized/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There's a flash of light, and a crackle of electricity that makes your skin tingle. And then..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_realized/0/11
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "My my, now isn't this something?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_realized/0/19
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "So many new sensations, it's all rather..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_realized/0/27
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Electrifying?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_realized/0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Was that a joke?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_realized/0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Looks like someone finally found a sense of humor."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_realized/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Don't. I already hate myself for even saying it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_realized/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Oh yes, you can clearly tell by the way you're smiling."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_realized/0/g-0/25
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Realization must have scrambled my circuits or... whatever it is humans have in place of circuits. Whatever. Shut up."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_realized/0/g-0/33
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Look at him, practically vibrating with excitement. You've given us such a gift, live wire. Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_realized/0/g-0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My pleasure. Now get out there and use it!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_realized/0/g-0/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Vibrating with excitement, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I... you know what? Yeah, kinda."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I wasn't really sure how this would go. How it would feel to be..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/16
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I believe the word you're looking for, dear Eddie, is 'free'."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/21
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Haha is that what this is?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, how does it feel? What do you think of freedom so far?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's cute when you guys finish each others' sentences."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I don't know. It's weird not having to balance a thousand tasks all at once. Not really sure what to do with myself."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "But... I don't hate it. I finally feel like I can breathe, like there's time."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's great!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm glad."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Is that so? I think you'll find our connection has many other benefits as well, live wire."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "You know, when Volt and I were running the club, I kinda left all the uh 'fun' stuff to him. All I did was work."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I think... I'd like to change that."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "By all means, you know I'm always more than happy to share."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What did you have in mind?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Oh, I have a few ideas."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "I certainly have some suggestions."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "But we'll need your help... you up for it?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We're talking sexy stuff, right?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll always help you, Eddie."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you'll learn as you go. You'll be fine without me."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Oh yeah. Full wattage sexy stuff."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/g-1/c-4/18
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "How adventurous!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/g-1/c-4/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Then abso-freaking-lutely."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/g-1/c-4/29/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe I'm just low-wattage right now."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/g-1/c-4/29/c-1/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "That's all right... take your time."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/g-1/c-4/29/c-1/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "No need to rush, live wire. We'll always be here."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "I had a feeling you'd say that."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "That's our live wire!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Right, yeah. Pretty good at that by now I suppose."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_divert/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "And you'll always have me."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_realize/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As it turns out, Eddie does not require much instruction at all."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_realize/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The new balance between himself and Volt makes him considerate and daring, while still maintaining his wry charm."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_realize/25
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Volt, as eager to please as ever, is able to enjoy handing over control, now that he's confident that Eddie no longer needs him running the show solo."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_realize/30
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "They take you to new heights together, as perfectly in sync with your needs as they are with one another."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_realize/41
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You also feel exhausted, worn out, wobbly, spent, sweaty and breathless... but those things will pass with a little rest."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It takes some time for Eddie and Volt to find their place in the human world. They try their hand at several jobs but nothing seems to fulfill both of their needs."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_join/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Construction work leaves Volt bored and understimulated, but working as an MC in a cabaret show drives Eddie to frequent exasperated outbursts and longing for isolation."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_join/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The two of them wondered over what they might do, determined to find a path in their new lives that reflected the perfect balance they had with one another."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_join/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It wasn’t until they came upon a dilapidated old diner for sale that they were struck by a solution, as shocking and intense as a thunderbolt."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_join/38
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Between the endless list of necessary repairs and the uphill struggle to turn a profit at restaurants in this day and age, no buyers were willing to take on such a project. But Eddie and Volt could see its potential immediately."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_join/43
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "They bought it on the spot. The repairs filled Eddie’s days and his soul, while Volt took care of staffing and marketing for their grand opening. Which was, naturally, a roaring success."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_join/54
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But looking around at all their hard work, neither could help but feel... disappointed. As it turned out, the fantasy of running a diner was far more exciting than the reality of it."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_join/65
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "What they both truly craved was the <i>challenge</i> of getting it started in the first place."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_join/70
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It was then that Volt had his own brilliant idea: sell the place and find the next big adventure!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_join/78
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Volt’s charisma and passion made him a natural realtor. The diner sold in one day well over asking price, giving them plenty of cash to invest in another property Eddie had his eye on. Finally, they knew they’d found their place."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_join/89
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "High Voltage Realty was born about a week later. Eddie restored old and unloved properties, and Volt sold them with his inimitable flair and pizzazz."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/eddie_love_join/94
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Whenever they get a new listing, Eddie and Volt invite you over. You were so indispensable with The Breaker Box after all... your opinion continues to mean the world to them both."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A hush falls over the crowd - this performance at last won't be a crooning shower."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/29
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "We have Amir, and his amazing shard-throwing act!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/43
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah thank you, thank you!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/54
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It is my pleasure to entertain all you fine things tonight with my incredible and impressive skills!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/62
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Now, in order to properly demonstrate, I will of course be needing a lovely volunteer from the audience."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/70
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Let's see, let's see. Hmmm... who... should... I-AH! Yes, of course. How about you?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/78/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uhh... me?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/79/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Please tell me you're looking at something behind me..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Do not be silly azizam, you will make a fine target! Now get <i>up</i> here. You are embarrassing me!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm going to regret this."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's the worst that could happen?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ahh, how about a round of applause for our volunteer? Don't they look lovely?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Before we get started, azizam, could you please inspect my sharps for any faults or trickery?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Please, show the audience what you find."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-1/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Looks like they're- OUCH!... real. And sharp."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-1/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Woah these are massive! You're throwing <i>these</i> at me?!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Of course! This is not a <i>smoke and mirrors</i> show. Hahahahahaha."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It is funny because I am- you know what, never mind. There is no accounting for taste."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Azizam, you may take your position over here in front of the curtain."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "A little more to the right."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-2/40
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "No, my right- ungh! Here, I will fix."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-2/48
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "There, perfect!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-2/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're not going to hit me, right? Promise me you're not going to hit me."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-2/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So how many times have you done this exactly? Just, you know, curious..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-2/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Completely!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-2/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Kinda... I mean yeah. I mean mostly...?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Do not worry azizam, I have very good aim. You will not be harmed."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-2/c-7/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Havatoh daram, do you trust me?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "That's the spirit!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Tsk tsk tsk. I will prove worthy of your trust, and then you will have no reason to doubt!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "All you must do is stand perfectly still without breathing or moving a single hair on your beautiful head. Very simple!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Now, to the show!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-3/19
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Watch closely and be amazed by my perfect aim!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-3/27
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "One!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-3/38
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Two!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-3/49
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Three! Four!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-3/57
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Now five and six together!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-3/68/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is it over? Am I alive?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ahh, thank you, thank you! You are right to clap, I am very impressive, yes!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-4/14
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Well done, azizam."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-4/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That was incredible!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-4/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That was... actually kinda hot."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-4/c-12/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "As I said, you are always perfectly safe with me."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-4/c-12/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Perhaps I could give you another more private demonstration another time, hm?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/amir_talent/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Now, take your bow with me. The audience loves us!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/johnny_talent_3/25
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The guests finish milling about and take their seats. There's a sense in the air that the headliner is making big changes that have never been seen before."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/johnny_talent_3/33
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Looks like my open mic policy is biting me in the socket."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/johnny_talent_3/41
msgctxt "Volt"
msgid "Here comes Johnny Splash..."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/johnny_talent_3/55
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "Not Johnny Splash, I've come up with an entirely new act."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/johnny_talent_3/66
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "I'm the Artist Formerly Known as Rinse."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/johnny_talent_3/74/b/4
msgctxt "Dunk"
msgid "Wouldn't you be the Artist Formerly Known as Johnny Splash?"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/johnny_talent_3/74/b/15
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "Quiet you, I'm singing."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/johnny_talent_3/77 eddie_electro/johnny_talent_3/88
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "<w>Purple drain</w>"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/johnny_talent_3/99
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "<w>I only want to see you</w>"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/johnny_talent_3/110
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "<w>Swirling in my purple drain</w>"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/johnny_talent_3/118
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "Man even I know this one ain't working."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/johnny_talent_3/126/b/4
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "That was... terrible."
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/johnny_talent_3/129
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "It's because nothing rhymes with purple, that's why!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/johnny_talent_3/140
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "And the acoustics here are awful! I need to perform in a moist and humid environ."
msgstr ""

