#: eddie_electro/johnny_coda/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "Stocks, bonds, and pie charts, Here Comes Johnny!"
msgstr ""

#: eddie_electro/johnny_coda/0/c-1/26
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "And, uh, thanks for the advice, you pretty thing."
msgstr ""

